      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Closing due to age.\nThis is actually possible now via SDK3 stations, as the station controller replaces the avatar controller while the player is in that station. As such, you can use the tracking state behavior to turn off IK for players completely in SDK3 stations.",
