  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-20T21:16:28.670Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A built in option into the sdk for stations to disable ik would be very useful. This way we could do dance animations like in the MMD world or any other number of animations more easily without having to worry about our head and hands being in an odd position because of ik.",
